g25 = generic 0.25 micron cmos technology.

variations
----------

g25		- 4 layer metal.
g25-NOA 	- g25, with no area rules checked.
g25-PG		- g25, "post generation":  nwell/n+ etc are not auto generated 

g25-1cm 	- similar to g25, but with .01 micron grid.

g25-tsmc 	- 5 layer tsmc process
g25-tsmcNOA 	- g25-tsmc, with no area rules checked.
g25-tsmcPG 	- g25-tsmc, "post generation": nwell/n+ etc are not auto generated
g25-tsmcPG01    - g25-tsmc, post generation, and on .01 micron grid.
g25-new		- 8/99: for max 3 release.
